# Config for @nimbo-chat/node-server now lives in the REPO-ROOT .env, not here.
#
# As of the 2026-07-12 consolidation, all config/secrets (DeepSeek, GitHub,
# Vercel, better-auth, ports) are in the single repo-root .env — see
# <repo>/.env.template. This server's dev script reads it via
# `--env-file-if-exists=../../.env`.
#
#   cd <repo> && cp .env.template .env   # then fill it in
#
# There is intentionally no apps/server/.env anymore. This stub stays only so
# a dev looking for the seed's usual .env.example is redirected here.
